{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Escape from the Underworld!</strong><br>In <i>Viking Breaker</i>, you play as Olaf, a Viking banished to the depths of Hell. Climb aboard your drakkar, sail across rivers of lava, and smash through infernal walls with your magical shields. Fight your way through hordes of demonic creatures and challenge the guardians of Helheim, Niflheim, and a corrupted Asgard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598580/extras/1d08d95602f28a9d75476c82bac657fa.poster.avif?t=1756914338\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598580/extras/1d08d95602f28a9d75476c82bac657fa.webm?t=1756914338\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598580/extras/1d08d95602f28a9d75476c82bac657fa.mp4?t=1756914338\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f <strong>Build your arsenal as you go!</strong><br>During your journey, choose from powerful upgrades: shields with unique effects, specialized crew members, and devastating rune powers. Create unique combinations in every run to overcome the growing dangers of the Underworld.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598580/extras/56682ffe9e1dd222bfc9ee9c81cb3437.poster.avif?t=1756914338\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598580/extras/56682ffe9e1dd222bfc9ee9c81cb3437.webm?t=1756914338\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598580/extras/56682ffe9e1dd222bfc9ee9c81cb3437.mp4?t=1756914338\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udea2 <strong>Upgrade your drakkar between runs!</strong><br>Between each attempt, spend your hard-earned gold to permanently enhance your drakkar. Increase its durability, speed, unlock new equipment, and prepare to venture even deeper in your next escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598580/extras/84bff81034fc4d0c66cab21187986e71.poster.avif?t=1756914338\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598580/extras/84bff81034fc4d0c66cab21187986e71.webm?t=1756914338\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598580/extras/84bff81034fc4d0c66cab21187986e71.mp4?t=1756914338\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a1 <strong>Key Features:</strong><br>\ud83e\ude93 Fast-paced arcade gameplay, inspired by brick-breakers and bullet hell shooters.<br>\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f 10 types of shields, each with unique powers.<br>\ud83d\udd25 Magical runes to turn the tide of battle.<br>\ud83d\udc79 Diverse enemies and epic bosses across 3 infernal worlds.<br>\ud83d\udea2 Roguelike progression: upgrade your drakkar and unlock new characters.<br>\ud83c\udfae Full controller support, designed for PC and consoles.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3598580?t=1756914338","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598580/76d96065c31c5889400d2a24ba120fc28cc18e94/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756914338","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598580/e2824ce8c0243a6ee0ed5b0110ffd8235c3c65e2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756914338","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.a